From 89e7e84be614b12246c343660cca37f9670653b2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian Dannapel <ian.dannapel@iris-sensing.com>
Date: Fri, 5 Jun 2026 09:19:24 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 09/29] media: adi: add PPI helper

Add the ADI PPI/EPPI helper used by the SC5xx capture bridge.
It resolves DMA channels from device tree, configures PPI transfer geometry, handles pinctrl mode selection and exports create/delete helpers to the capture driver.

Signed-off-by: Ian Dannapel <ian.dannapel@iris-sensing.com>
---
